s-declared-illegal-us-flight-meltdown-exposes-ageing-air-traffic-control-system-and-more/articleshow/135833292.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135833292.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi raises concerns over the integrity of the 2024 Lok Sabha elections by questioning the Election Commission's voter classification. Meanwhile, a serious communications error led to a nationwide flight stoppage, affecting more than 1.5 million passengers. Jensen Huang faces notable financial setbacks following his departure from Nvidia but still holds significant wealth in the company's shares.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-rahul-gandhi-questions-legitimacy-of-2024-polls-alleges-140-million-voters-declared-illegal-us-flight-meltdown-exposes-ageing-air-traffic-control-system-and-more/articleshow/135833292.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-newswrap-rahul-gandhi-questions-legitimacy-of-2024-polls-alleges-140-million-voters-declared-illegal-us-flight-meltdown-exposes-ageing-air-traffic-control-system-and-more/articleshow/135833292.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T18:26:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135833525,imgsize-117967.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Time to lower juvenile age to 16’: Kerala HC flags changing maturity levels]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/time-to-lower-juvenile-age-to-16-kerala-hc-flags-changing-maturity-levels/articleshow/135832761.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135832761.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiati